  "full_text": "Might as well send J.P.O. your way. Yes, Sergeant Major. Corporal Person, be advised. You're expected to conduct all business in this camp in compliance with the grooming standard. Under direct order from the battalion commander himself. Your mustache hair is in violations. Going beyond the corner of your mouth. I hear Godfather Hisset say, you look like a bomb. Mr. Potato Head, at your six. Closing fast. From your face, beyond your mouth areas. You are unsightly, unsanitary, and in violations of Godfather's room and standards. You hash the old dog hungry down, fuck yourself. Watch it! Watch it! I'm already... Get your shit off your lip. Can't you be humble? You mocking the room and standards staff? Nah, Sergeant Major. It's scroogey. I want to see a clean, pretty smile before we step off. First lights tomorrow, I expect all y'all to be in clean shape. That's what we've just been through. There's a lot that can go wrong out here. Like a bakery, a cold cow, like a pussy. But the one thing these men can count on is a grooming standard. I believe it always ought to be there for them. What's this about you losing your cap and all that? It bounced off my head, Sergeant Major, last night. Mouth stuff you hate. I was up on the 50 Cal and the Humvee went over a berm, Sergeant Major. I was going to say, there's that pee in your ass. What happens when you don't enforce grooming standards? The man gets all lax. No helmets, pussies. You want the glory there, man. You wanna show the fucking glory? Just fuck it, man. Guy said no helmets. What's more important my voice. I got a colorful voice It's gonna do like magic and like squeak cuz like it wants a fucking pure voice. Let's do some singing with like a fucking Tripped out fucking magic voice. It's gonna squeak",
